---
source: tests/it/render_images.rs
expression: "render_fixture(\"images.md\",\n&with_images(&Capabilities::plain(WIDTH), fixture_images(\"images.md\")))"
---
# Images

  An image alone in a paragraph is shown at
  its natural size:

  [image: Test pattern]

  A small image is not enlarged:

  [image: Icon]

  A wide image shrinks to the text width:

  [image: Panorama]

  An SVG is drawn at its natural size, here
  given in millimetres:

  [image: Sunset icon]

  Text in an SVG is drawn with the system's
  fonts:

  [image: Forces on an airfoil]

  A linked image is shown, but cannot be
  clicked yet:

  [image: Linked icon] <https://example.com>

  - An image in a list:

    [image: Transparent in a list]

  - [image: Alone in a list item]

  > An image in a quote:
  >
  > [image: Quoted panorama]

  In running text, [image: an inline icon]
  stays alt text, and so does [image: an icon]
  with words <https://example.com> in a link.

  ╭──────────────────────┬───────────────────╮
  │ Image                │ Note              │
  ├──────────────────────┼───────────────────┤
  │ [image: Icon in a    │ Alt text in a     │
  │ cell]                │ table             │
  ╰──────────────────────┴───────────────────╯

  A missing file, a file that is no image, a
  broken SVG and a remote image show their alt
  text:

  [image: Missing image]

  [image: Not an image]

  [image: Broken SVG]

  [image: Remote image]
